{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026AWLEZnxLfG1788018731.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">俄軍攻擊烏克蘭首都基輔，市郊一個倉庫，烏方稱有至少37人死亡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當地有建築物起火，冒出大量濃煙，消防員到場灌救。俄羅斯指，攻擊針對的倉庫，儲存了長程無人機的零件和發射助推器。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.UKR.ATTACK-2301_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026wIwMAIvHsF1788018807.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.UKR.ATTACK-2301_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">烏方則指俄方的無人機襲擊，造成至少50座住宅大廈受損。烏克蘭總統澤連斯基，不滿住宅區附近，存放了爆炸性物品和材料，表明要嚴懲負責的人。當局正調查是否有人非法存放爆炸品。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T15:59:35.927735+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}